Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 05:09:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Never index the same share twice under another name or IP

smb://TPLINK/Video and smb://192.168.1.10/Video are one folder: adding
or scanning it again under the other spelling is refused with a message
naming the library folder already covering it, instead of indexing and
scraping every video twice.
